Phong Vo and Glenn Fowler, AT&T Research.
.SH STANDARDS
None. The
.B fts
interface was considered for inclusion in the POSIX standard,
but was rejected in favor of
.IR nftw (3)
in 1997.
This
.IR LIBAST (3)
.B fts
implementation diverges significantly from the BSD and Linux versions.
.SH HISTORY
The original
.B fts
interface appeared in 4.4BSD (1993).
This
.B fts
interface was written from scratch and added to
.IR LIBAST (3)
on 1996-08-11.
